# 04: the dimension-eight squared term, 1/Lambda^8 (one insertion in each amplitude, NP<=2 NP^2==4).
# Positive definite; formally the same order as dimension-six-squared and dimension-eight
# interference from a dimension-six model, which this model does not contain.
# NOTE: this script used to set c8W2H2D2x1, which is class 7 and has NO diagram in
# p p > w+ w- (its lowest vertex is four-point and bosonic, so one insertion cannot
# enter a two-to-two diboson process).  It contributed exactly nothing.  Replaced with
# an operator that does contribute; see examples/studies/diboson/table.md.
import model dim8_is
generate p p > w+ w- NP<=2 NP^2==4
output runs/04_ww_sq
launch runs/04_ww_sq
set nevents 5000
set hel_recycling False
set ebeam1 6800
set ebeam2 6800
set lam__2 1000
set c8q2WH2Dx1 1.0
set c8q2W2Dx1 1.0
done
